    <div class="section-label-alt">The Plan</div>
    <h2>How I'll sell it.</h2>
    <p class="approach-intro">
      The full marketing plan, the published 2.7% fee, and the weekly reporting I run on every listing are on one page you can read start to finish. For your house:
    </p>
    <ul class="approach-list">
      <li><strong>Professional photography with written captions.</strong> The photos have to carry the size and the lot.</li>
      <li><strong>List at $399,000 and get day one right.</strong> This neighborhood averages 14 days and 102.6% of list. Most of the work happens before the sign goes in the yard.</li>
      <li><strong>A written update from me every week:</strong> showings, feedback, and my read.</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="portal-link" href="/how-i-sell">
