    <h2>What the sale actually clears.</h2>
    <p class="fees-intro">
      My listing fee is <strong>2.7%</strong>, published on my <a href="/how-i-sell">marketing plan page</a>. Plan on the same 2.7% for the buyer's agent; that part's negotiable. The estimator below runs the full cost of the sale on Trademark Title's fee schedule. It's set to $399,000. Drag it to test other numbers.
    </p>

    <div class="calc" id="calc">
      <div class="calc-label">Estimated net to you</div>

      <div class="calc-live" id="calc-live" hidden>
        <label class="calc-input-wrap" for="calc-price">
          <span class="calc-input-label">Sale price</span>
          <input type="text" id="calc-price" inputmode="numeric" value="$399,000" autocomplete="off" />
        </label>
        <input type="range" id="calc-slider" min="250000" max="500000" step="1000" value="399000" aria-label="Sale price slider" />
