          <div class="calc-row"><div>Buyer's agent compensation (2.7%)</div><div class="mono" id="calc-buyer">$10,773</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row"><div>Minnesota state deed tax (0.33%)</div><div class="mono" id="calc-deed">$1,317</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row"><div>Settlement fee</div><div class="mono">$595</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row"><div>Conservation fee</div><div class="mono">$5</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row"><div>Transaction fee</div><div class="mono">$625</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row calc-final"><div>Total cost to sell</div><div class="mono" id="calc-total">$24,088</div></div>
          <div class="calc-row calc-clear"><div>Net to you, before loan payoff &amp; prorated taxes</div><div class="mono" id="calc-clear">$374,912</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-static" id="calc-static">
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="fee-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Sale price</th>
                <th class="r">Listing 2.7%</th>
                <th class="r">Buyer 2.7%</th>
                <th class="r">Deed tax + closing</th>
                <th class="r">Total cost</th>
                <th class="r">Net to you</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>$385,000</td><td class="r">$10,395</td><td class="r">$10,395</td><td class="r">$2,496</td><td class="r">$23,286</td><td class="r">$361,714</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$399,000</td><td class="r">$10,773</td><td class="r">$10,773</td><td class="r">$2,542</td><td class="r">$24,088</td><td class="r">$374,912</td></tr>
              <tr><td>$412,000</td><td class="r">$11,124</td><td class="r">$11,124</td><td class="r">$2,585</td><td class="r">$24,833</td><td class="r">$387,167</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="calc-note">These are Trademark Title's actual seven-county-metro fees: settlement $595, conservation $5, transaction $625, plus Minnesota's 0.33% state deed tax. It runs the same math as Trademark's own net-sheet tool, so this lines up with their calculator at the same price. It leaves out your remaining loan payoff and prorated property taxes, which are specific to your closing. Trademark's net sheet at closing is the exact number.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CLOSING -->
